        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Safari 27 supports sizes="auto" for <img>]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30629</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30629"/>
        <updated>2026-09-23T13:39:26.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145881415?u=5b117134a04a7742227d7d62858c1694d15fa652&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Sets Safari support for the <code class="notranslate">auto</code> value of the <code class="notranslate">&lt;img sizes&gt;</code> attribute (<code class="notranslate">html.elements.img.sizes.auto</code>) to <code class="notranslate">version_added: "27"</code>, removing the now-obsolete <code class="notranslate">impl_url</code> bug reference. <code class="notranslate">safari_ios</code> continues to mirror.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Official WebKit release notes for Safari 27.0 list <code class="notranslate">sizes="auto"</code> under responsive images: <a href="https://webkit.org/blog/18325/webkit-features-for-safari-27-0/#responsive-images" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/blog/18325/webkit-features-for-safari-27-0/#responsive-images</a></li>
<li>The implementing WebKit bug <a href="https://webkit.org/b/253143" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/b/253143</a> is resolved, and the change was confirmed by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/caugner/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/caugner">@caugner</a> in the linked issue to have landed in WebKit 625.1.11 before the Safari 27 branch point.</li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #30607.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5537867962" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30607" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30607/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30607">#30607</a></p>]]></content>
